Specifically, we employ LLaMA-2-7b\footnote{\url{https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf}} for English-target directions (X$\rightarrow$En) and LLaMA-2-13b for non-English-target directions (En$\rightarrow$X), as LLaMA-2 shows superior ability on English language while less-optimal on other languages.
